text=['# Response to Amaury — scientific revision prepared for author review','Reference: comments emailed 10 October 2026, 17:49:08 UTC. This document is a prepared response; no email has been sent.','Dear Amaury,','Thank you for your review. We have implemented all six scientific clarification requests using the corrected primary configuration and an independently checked reproduction of the historical pipeline. The revised package includes the clean manuscript, comparison copy, supplementary material, figures, full scenario results and provenance records. The following responses describe completed changes; author declarations and approval of the final interpretation remain for both authors.']
