text+=['## Declarations and journal selection','The no-funding and no-conflicts wording is carried forward from the sent PDF, explicitly requiring confirmation from both authors. No formally granted ethics approval or exemption is asserted. A separate checklist identifies the institutional/journal determination still needed, along with final contributions, affiliations and review of AI-assisted work. Journal selection and submission remain outside this execution.','The reference PDF was fixed by SHA-256. The historical pipeline reproduced all selection counts, age aggregates and primary denominator cells exactly with the recovered official files. SIM 2020–2021 hashes match the available historical audit; absence of historical execution hashes for SIM 2014–2019 remains a documentary limitation. R 4.6.1 and current package versions are recorded; very small numerical environment differences, including unstable large-theta estimates near the Poisson limit, are documented.','Best regards,','Federico — draft for both authors to review']
